{% doc %}
  @prompt
    【核心灵活性要求（重要）】
    
    文案可配置： 页面上所有的文本内容（包括产品标题、卖点小标题、核心卖点列表、价格、标签及按钮文字）都必须在 Shopify 后台定义为可动态编辑的文本字段（Schema settings），方便后期随时调整。
    
    媒体源动态切换： 左侧展示区域不仅要支持上传静态图片，还要支持上传/嵌入视频（如 MP4 或 Shopify Files 视频链接）。后台需提供图片和视频的切换或自适应选项。
    
    一、 整体布局与尺寸规范 (Layout & Sizing)
    容器最大宽度 (Max-Width): 1140px - 1200px（保持与首页现有通栏/Container一致）。
    
    安全高度 (Desktop Height): 整体视窗高度控制在 420px - 480px 之间（包含上下 Padding），确保桌面端视觉占比不超过半屏。
    
    上下内边距 (Padding): padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 50px;（避免留白过大，保持紧凑）。
    
    对齐方式: 左右两栏在垂直方向上需 居中对齐 (align-items: center)。
    
    分栏比例 (Desktop Flex Ratio): * 左右两栏比例调整为 40 : 60 左右。
    
    左侧 (媒体展示区): 占比 40%，限制最大宽度不超过 360px。
    
    右侧 (文案与CTA区): 占比 60%，两栏间距 (gap) 设为 40px。
    
    二、 视觉与元素细节 (UI & Design Elements)
    1. 左侧：媒体展示卡片 (Media Card)
    卡片样式: 浅灰色微弱边框/背景（建议使用比主背景略深的浅灰，如 #F5F5F5），带有轻微圆角（border-radius: 8px）。
    
    媒体兼容: * 图片模式: 产品图在卡片内居中展示，四周保留等距留白。
    
    视频模式: 视频需自动适配卡片尺寸（object-fit: cover 或 contain），默认设置为静音、自动循环播放、不显示原生控制条 (autoplay, loop, muted, playsinline)。
    
    2. 右侧：信息层级 (Typography & Content - 全文本可动态配置)
    新品标签 (Optional Tag): 最上方预留一个亮橙色或小字号的 NEW ARRIVAL 顶标。
    
    产品标题 (Product Title): ATIVAFIT VOLT ROPELESS BATTLE ROPE
    
    样式: 全大写、加粗、无衬线字体。
    
    字号: 桌面端降级至 24px - 28px，行高适中。
    
    卖点提示 (Sub-heading): WHY PEOPLE LOVE IT:（字号约 14px，品牌亮橙色）。
    
    核心卖点列表 (Features List): 逐行排列，前方带有亮橙色的对勾图标（✓），字号 16px。
    
    价格与标签 (Price & Label): 价格字号加粗放大（约 24px），下方或右侧紧跟促销标签 (LAUNCH SPECIAL)。
    
    3. 行动导向按钮 (CTA Button)
    按钮文本: [🛒 图标] ADD TO CART（文字与链接后台可配）
    
    样式: 高饱和度品牌暖橙色背景，圆角矩形（border-radius: 4px - 6px）。宽度不需要拉满通栏，建议设置为固定宽度（如 180px - 200px）或与上方文案等宽。
    
    三、 响应式适配 (Responsive / Mobile Layout)
    断点切换 (Breakpoint): 在移动端（如 768px 以下）自动切换为 上下单栏布局 (flex-direction: column)。
    
    高度调整: 移动端整体高度自适应（Auto），整体控制在约 500px 内。
    
    元素微调: 左侧媒体卡片缩小（高度建议 240px - 280px），移动端视频同样保持静音自动循环。
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding: 50px 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 40%;
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.media_card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.media_card_border }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} video {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 4px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 4px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.tag_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.tag_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.tag_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 8px 0 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.feature_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.feature_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.feature_icon_color }};
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-hero-price-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.price_label_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.price_label_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_label_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .ai-product-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
  }

  .ai-product-hero-button-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 16px;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 100%;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size | times: 0.85 }}px;
    }

    .ai-product-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-product-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-product-hero-media-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-product-hero-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.media_type == 'video' and block.settings.video_url != blank %}
          <video
            autoplay
            loop
            muted
            playsinline
            src="{{ block.settings.video_url }}"
          ></video>
        {% elsif block.settings.product_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.product_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.product_image.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.product_image.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.product_image.height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-product-hero-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-product-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.show_tag and block.settings.tag_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-product-hero-tag-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.tag_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.product_title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-product-hero-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.product_title }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subheading_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-product-hero-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.subheading_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.feature_1 != blank or block.settings.feature_2 != blank or block.settings.feature_3 != blank or block.settings.feature_4 != blank %}
        <ul class="ai-product-hero-features-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.feature_1 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-product-hero-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</span>
              <span>{{ block.settings.feature_1 }}</span>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_2 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-product-hero-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</span>
              <span>{{ block.settings.feature_2 }}</span>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_3 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-product-hero-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</span>
              <span>{{ block.settings.feature_3 }}</span>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_4 != blank %}
            <li class="ai-product-hero-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <span class="ai-product-hero-feature-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</span>
              <span>{{ block.settings.feature_4 }}</span>
            </li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ai-product-hero-price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.price_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-product-hero-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.price_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.show_price_label and block.settings.price_label_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-product-hero-price-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.price_label_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
          class="ai-product-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {% if block.settings.show_button_icon %}
            <span class="ai-product-hero-button-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">🛒</span>
          {% endif %}
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ProductHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        const video = this.querySelector('video');
        if (video) {
          video.play().catch(function() {});
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('product-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ProductHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "产品展示区块",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "媒体设置"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "media_type",
      "label": "媒体类型",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "image",
          "label": "图片"
        },
        {
          "value": "video",
          "label": "视频"
        }
      ],
      "default": "image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "产品图片"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "video_url",
      "label": "视频链接",
      "info": "输入 MP4 视频文件的完整 URL"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "media_card_background",
      "label": "媒体卡片背景色",
      "default": "#f5f5f5"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "media_card_border",
      "label": "媒体卡片边框色",
      "default": "#e8e8e8"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "新品标签"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_tag",
      "label": "显示标签",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tag_text",
      "label": "标签文字",
      "default": "NEW ARRIVAL"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tag_font_size",
      "label": "标签字号",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 18,
      "step": 1,
